{"title":"Center for Talent Development","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Center for Talent Development at Northwestern University is a program for gifted students of all ages.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Links\">Links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talent_Development&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Links\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>CTD's website is here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.ctd.northwestern.edu\">https://www.ctd.northwestern.edu</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017153346\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.002 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.002 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19240:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017153346 and revision id 128633. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}